1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,619
Hands busy. Tutorial paused.

2
00:00:02,779 --> 00:00:04,655
Where does the next step belong?

3
00:00:04,815 --> 00:00:07,744
Reel to Real brings the guide into your
workspace.

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:11,818
Start with a short tutorial you own or have
permission to use.

5
00:00:11,978 --> 00:00:14,555
Reel to Real turns it into a step guide.

6
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:24,635
Five Samples replay saved instructions, media,
and recorded SAM output, with creator credit.

7
00:00:24,795 --> 00:00:29,349
The lesson stays labelled as a recorded Sample
throughout playback and coaching.

8
00:00:29,509 --> 00:00:33,252
Explore this guided experience without a
camera or model key.

9
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:40,076
Now, the live path.

10
00:00:40,236 --> 00:00:44,382
This owned, generated six-second clip contains
red and blue shapes.

11
00:00:44,542 --> 00:00:47,840
The complete clip goes to the real Muse Spark
API.

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,552
Its response becomes a structured lesson,
including later content.

13
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:02,390
The coach sends virtual-camera keyframes to
the real SAM API.

14
00:01:02,550 --> 00:01:05,590
It highlights detected objects for this step.

15
00:01:05,750 --> 00:01:08,678
This synthetic camera test can miss objects.

16
00:01:08,838 --> 00:01:11,395
A highlight cannot verify technique.

17
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:20,039
You stay in control.

18
00:01:20,199 --> 00:01:23,801
Next records your confirmation. Skip is
explicit.

19
00:01:23,961 --> 00:01:30,322
The recap separates confirmed steps, visible
objects, skipped steps, and unvisited steps.

20
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:36,321
Or start with a goal and one workspace still.

21
00:01:36,481 --> 00:01:39,857
This alternate route has no tutorial
timestamps.

22
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:43,554
Muse Spark plans the sequence.

23
00:01:43,714 --> 00:01:46,551
SAM localizes each step's objects.

24
00:01:46,711 --> 00:01:51,374
The app server keeps model credentials out of
the browser and bounds requests.

25
00:01:53,300 --> 00:01:56,712
Physical-device trials and learner studies are
next.

26
00:01:56,872 --> 00:01:59,503
Try the prototype and explore the source.

27
00:01:59,663 --> 00:02:02,067
Reel to Real: from watching to doing.
